              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jane Hanley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good! I made this recipe as-is even though I was not sure about adding the sugar. All 4 of us liked it, including my 4 and 6 year old daughters. I will use this recipe again but will leave out the sugar. The raisins add enough sweet."
          },
          {
