            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kimberly V"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It seems like an odd side dish, but I was looking for something like this for a breakfast substitute since I ran out of oatmeal. It's delicious. \n\nI used 2% milk, golden raisins, butter and Thai jasmine rice.",
            "datePublished": "2020-10-11T18:35:07.253Z"
          },
