            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tallrx"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Didn't have any raisins on hand, used dried cranberries instead. I also decided not to top with sugar. This is a fantastic recipe, would never have though to throw dried fruit in to my rice...next time apricots!!",
            "datePublished": "2014-03-19T19:29:43.387Z"
